msgstr "سطر"

#. i18n: ectx: (Import Microsoft EXCEL sheet) <dialog label="Import Microsoft
#. EXCEL sheet"> [...] <frame label="Start row / column (\"0\" for
#. automatic)"> <spinbox label="...">
#. i18n: ectx: (Import Microsoft EXCEL sheet) <dialog label="Import Microsoft
#. EXCEL sheet"> [...] <frame label="End row / column (\"0\" for automatic)">
